# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data and model artefacts are regenerated by the pipeline, never committed.
# The whole of data/ is ~2 GB; GitHub is not a data store.
# `python src/step01_download.py` rebuilds data/raw/ from the BTS source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/

# Large model binaries and raw prediction dumps (results/ keeps the small
# metric tables and figures/ keeps the plots, and those ARE committed).
*.ubj
*.joblib
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.parquet

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

